:"2026-10-18T12:17:46.295470+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T11:17:32.753670+00:00","content_hash":"63e188e8fa9b07d6159f4f9ac91fddb9f02feabcccfd3ff664e4d6c49b8a7e83","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}